# Card 1zBkhSZm. `scripts/__pycache__/check-marketplace-coverage.cpython-313.pyc`
# was TRACKED on a public marketplace repo — machine-specific compiled bytecode
# that rewrites itself on use. Running the SCRIPT leaves the tree clean (it runs
# as __main__); running the TEST SUITE imports the module, so Python rewrites the
# cache and every contributor who runs the tests gets a dirty working tree, one
# `git commit -a` away from shipping their own bytecode here.
